<title>UK: Atlantic Telecom signs order with Tadiran.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Telecom signs order with Tadiran.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Telecom Group Plc said on Wednesday that a wholly owned subsidiary, Atlantic Telecommunications Ltd, had placed an order worth 3.13 million stg with Israel's Tadiran Telecommunications Ltd .</p>
<p>The telecoms group said the order was for further infrastructure and customer equipment units &quot;to continue the development of its fixed radio access network&quot; which is being built in Glasgow, Scotland.</p>
<p>It gave no further details of the order, which it said would be settled in cash.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7719</p>
</text>
